WEBVTT

00:03:29.553 --> 00:03:31.862
You know what can't be hacked remotely?

00:03:32.418 --> 00:03:33.574
Curtains.

00:03:33.598 --> 00:03:34.599
(Laughter)

00:03:34.623 --> 00:03:36.037
Fences.

00:03:36.061 --> 00:03:37.221
Door locks.

00:03:37.245 --> 00:03:38.386
(Laughter)

00:03:38.410 --> 00:03:40.756
Privacy is not the enemy of safety.

00:03:41.113 --> 00:03:42.565
It is its guarantor.

00:03:44.129 --> 00:03:48.114
Nonetheless, we daily face
a propaganda onslaught

00:03:48.138 --> 00:03:52.228
telling us that we have to give up
some privacy in exchange for safety

00:03:52.252 --> 00:03:54.252
through surveillance programs.

00:03:55.085 --> 00:03:59.084
Face surveillance is the most dangerous
of these technologies.

00:03:59.966 --> 00:04:05.133
There are two primary ways today
governments use technologies like this.